Features of xpat2 include:
- new rule sets (Midnight Oil, Monte Carlo, Idiot's Delight)
- loadable keyboard tables and messages (needed for internationalisation)
- Athena Widget support (looks best with Xaw3d!)
- online help (Xaw version only)
- antialiased rank and suit symbols
- configuration files for card layout

